-NEW101-0242","nodeId":"FACT101-ARCHED-NEW101-0242","anchor":"MAJOR:ARCHITECTURE","subject":"Match each building with its credited architect or design team.\nA. Hôtel Tassel\nB. Casa Batlló\nC. Secession Building\n1. Antoni Gaudí\n2. Joseph Maria Olbrich\n3. Victor Horta","value":"A–3 · B–1 · C–2","group":"Architectural relationships","major":"Architecture","relation":"review question","references":[],"explanation74":"Hôtel Tassel — Victor Horta; Casa Batlló — Antoni Gaudí; Secession Building — Joseph Maria Olbrich.","previewOnly95":false,"review101":"editorially_reviewed"},{"id":"FACT101-ARCHED-NEW101-0243","nodeId":"FACT101-ARCHED-NEW101-0243","anchor":"MAJOR:ARCHITECTURE","subject":"Match each building with its credited architect or design team.\nA. Secession Building\nB. Austrian Postal Savings Bank\nC. Glasgow School of Art\n1. Joseph Maria Olbrich\n2. Otto Wagner\n3. Charles Rennie Mackintosh","value":"A–1 · B–2 · C–3","group":"Architectural relationships","major":"Architecture","relation":"review question","references":[],"explanation74":"Secession Building — Joseph Maria Olbrich; Austrian Postal Savings Bank — Otto Wagner; Glasgow School of Art — Charles Rennie Mackintosh.","previewOnly95":false,"review101":"editorially_reviewed"},{"id":"FACT101-ARCHED-NEW101-0244","nodeId":"FACT101-ARCHED-NEW101-0244","anchor":"MAJOR:ARCHITECTURE","subject":"Match each building with its credited architect or design team.\nA. Unity Temple\nB. AEG Turbine Factory\nC. Fagus Factory\n1. Frank Lloyd Wright\n2. Peter Behrens\n3. Walter Gropius and Adolf Meyer","value":"A–1 · B–2 · C–3","group":"Architectural relationships","major":"Architecture","relation":"review question","references":[],"explanation74":"Unity Temple — Frank Lloyd Wright; AEG Turbine Factory — Peter Behrens; Fagus Factory — Walter Gropius and Adolf Meyer.","previewOnly95":false,"review101":"editorially_reviewed"},{"id":"FACT101-ARCHED-NEW101-0245","nodeId":"FACT101-ARCHED-NEW101-0245","anchor":"MAJOR:ARCHITECTU