"Existing Tapestry historical record","verificationUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Council_of_Clermont","recordId":"t63-0184ac2bf704","supportScope":"Saved chronological reference; not newly fetched"}],"explanation74":"Battle of Hastings and Norman conquest (1066 CE); Council of Clermont (1095 CE); Teutonic Order founded (1190 CE).","previewOnly95":false,"review101":"editorially_reviewed"},{"id":"FACT101-ARCHED-NEW101-0458","nodeId":"FACT101-ARCHED-NEW101-0458","anchor":"MAJOR:HISTORY-AND-POLITICS","subject":"Place these events in chronological order, from earliest to latest.\nA. September 11 attacks\nB. Gandhi assassinated\nC. International Atomic Energy Agency established","value":"B → C → A","group":"Historical sequence","major":"History & Politics","relation":"review question","references":[{"file":"Existing Tapestry historical record","verificationUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=September%2011%20attacks","recordId":"t68-cade75e570dc","supportScope":"Saved chronological reference; not newly fetched"},{"file":"Existing Tapestry historical record","verificationUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=Gandhi%20assassinated","recordId":"t68-5e8f86a16268","supportScope":"Saved chronological reference; not newly fetched"},{"file":"Existing Tapestry historical record","verificationUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=International%20Atomic%20Energy%20Agency%20established","recordId":"t68-b9eb8d737ff9","supportScope":"Saved chronological reference; not newly fetched"}],"explanation74":"Gandhi assassinated (1948 CE); International Atomic Energy Agency established (1957 CE); September 11 attacks (2001 CE).","previewOnly95":false,"review101":"editorially_reviewed"},{"id":"FACT101-ARCHED-NEW101-0459","nodeId":"FACT101-ARCHED-NEW101-0459","anchor":"MAJOR:HISTORY-AND-POLITICS","subject":"Place these events in chronological order, from earliest to latest.\nA. League of Nations begins operating\nB. London Underground opens\nC. Paris Commune","value":"B → C → A","group":"Historical sequence","major":"History & Politics","relation":"review question","references":[{"file":"Existing Tapestry historical record","verificationUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=League%20of%20Nations%20begins%20operating","recordId":"t68-733f9bef18b3","supportScope":"Saved chronological reference; not newly fetched"},{"file":"Existing Tapestry historical record","verificationUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=London%20Underground%20opens","recordId":"t68-de39727786e5","supportScope":"Saved chronological reference; not newly fetched"},{"file":"Existing Tapestry historical record","verificationUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=Paris%20Commune","recordId":"t68-d781d2f7abff","supportScope":"Saved chronological reference; not newly fetched"}],"explanation74":"London Underground opens (1863 CE); Paris Commune (1871 CE); League of Nations begins operating (1920 CE).","previewOnly95":false,"review101":"editorially_reviewed"},{"id":"FACT101-ARCHED-NEW101-0460","nodeId":"FACT101-ARCHED-NEW101-0460","anchor":"MAJOR:HISTORY-AND-POLITICS","subject":"Place these events in chronological order, from earliest to latest.\nA. Dollfuss assassinated in Austrian Nazi coup attempt\nB. Truman Doctrine\nC. OPEC founded","value":"A → B → C","group":"Historical sequence","major":"History & Politics","relation":"review question","references":[{"file":"Existing Tapestry historical record","verificationUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=Dollfuss%20assassinated%20in%20Austrian%20Nazi%20coup%20attempt","recordId":"t68-af4ce98c2278","supportScope":"Saved chronological reference; not newly fetched"},{"file":"Existing Tapestry historical record","verificationUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?search=Truman%20Doctrine","recordId":"t68-f433458ff075","supportScope":"Saved chronological reference; not newly fetched"},{"file":"Existing Tapestry historical record","verificationUrl":"https://en